            "text": "Ciliochloa is a genus of grasses. It includes four species native to Mediterranean Europe, North Africa, and Western Asia from the Levant to Turkmenistan.\nCiliochloa effusa {{small|(Link) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}\nCiliochloa elegans {{small|(Desf.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}\nCiliochloa gracilis {{small|(Viv.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}\nCiliochloa turcomanica {{small|(Proskur.) Röser, Tkach & Rasti}}"
